# Bloat beneath Python’s Scales: A Fine-Grained Inter-Project Dependency Analysis
This is the artifact for the paper accepted to FSE'24 titled:
"Bloat beneath Python’s Scales: A Fine-Grained Inter-Project Dependency Analysis".

# Table of Contents
